<title>FINLAND: RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS 1,000 LAKES RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS 1,000 LAKES RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>JYVASKYLA, Finland 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tommi Makinen of Finland, driving a Mitsubishi, on Monday won the 1,000 Lakes Rally, sixth round of the world championship.</p>
</text>
